 "capa": "IT COUNTS WITH YOU",
 "descripcion": "Mira counted again, and finally understood rule two. The end of The Hut on the Pass.\n\nWould you have run?\n\nNarrated fiction. New story every week.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "I counted again. One. Just me.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "But I could still hear three people breathing.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then I understood rule two.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "You count every hour to notice who joined.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "I climbed out the back window, into the snow.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "I skied down in the dark for three hours.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "At dawn, rescuers found the hut locked from inside.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Carved under the rules, a new line: four went in.",
   "pausa": 0.9
  },
  {
   "texto": "Now I never count out loud. Something up there counts with me.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  }
 ],
